<title>USA: Gunther gets initial orders from US govt.</title>
<headline>Gunther gets initial orders from US govt.</headline>
<dateline>NORWICH, Conn. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gunther International Limited said on Monday it was awarded $1.2 million in government orders.</p>
<p>The orders are for the company's intelligent document finishing systems and are to be delivered within the next four months.</p>
<p>Gunther manufacturers for the high speed automated document finishing industry.</p>
</text>
